{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00183",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 4.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? They told me to come straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "end_seconds": 9.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.61,
      "end_seconds": 25.82,
      "duration_seconds": 15.21,
      "text": "It's burning in both feet. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.35,
      "end_seconds": 29.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Alright, is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.9,
      "end_seconds": 37.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Probably two months. Yeah. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.26,
      "end_seconds": 45.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.62,
      "end_seconds": 65.75,
      "duration_seconds": 20.13,
      "text": "Bedsheets touching them definitely sets it off. I'd say severe. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I've also been feeling unsteady in the dark, for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.15,
      "end_seconds": 69.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Have you had any bladder problems or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.53,
      "end_seconds": 72.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.81,
      "end_seconds": 76.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "And hand symptoms, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.03,
      "end_seconds": 78.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No. No hand symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.11,
      "end_seconds": 92.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.94,
      "end_seconds": 98.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.11,
      "end_seconds": 102.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.84,
      "end_seconds": 105.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.08,
      "end_seconds": 107.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.34,
      "end_seconds": 110.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.76,
      "end_seconds": 114.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.45,
      "end_seconds": 115.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.54,
      "end_seconds": 130.71,
      "duration_seconds": 14.17,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.15,
      "end_seconds": 133.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.29,
      "end_seconds": 141.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.64,
      "end_seconds": 151.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.6,
      "end_seconds": 164.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.01,
      "end_seconds": 168.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.1,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.02,
      "end_seconds": 192.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.55,
      "end_seconds": 194.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.99,
      "end_seconds": 197.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.1,
      "end_seconds": 216.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Feeling of light touch is reduced in both feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.8,
      "end_seconds": 218.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.73,
      "end_seconds": 231.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.99,
      "end_seconds": 235.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.95,
      "end_seconds": 236.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.36,
      "end_seconds": 255.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.45,
      "end_seconds": 258.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.26,
      "end_seconds": 275.0,
      "duration_seconds": 15.74,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning in both feet for two months, severe, and no hand symptoms or bladder problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.28,
      "end_seconds": 277.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.79,
      "end_seconds": 288.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an HbA1c for neuropathy. Let's use pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night, for four weeks. That should help with nerve pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.11,
      "end_seconds": 292.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.04,
      "end_seconds": 306.28,
      "duration_seconds": 12.24,
      "text": "Check your feet every evening for cuts or blisters, you may not feel them. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. We'll refer you to podiatry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.99,
      "end_seconds": 307.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.04,
      "end_seconds": 323.71,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back after the results are back. Right, just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.24,
      "end_seconds": 333.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "So, I take the pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.14,
      "end_seconds": 339.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.09,
      "end_seconds": 344.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.86,
      "end_seconds": 346.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}